A suggestion: (yes, one more...)

How about changing the name of a wand of death to wand of disintegration
and making it destroy (non-artifact) objects it hits?

This would have three (dis?)advantages:
1. A simple way to destroy an object.
2. It would limit the power of the wand - you don't always want to
destroy corpses and items the monsters are carrying.
3. A monster zaps the wand at you. Your amulet of life saving protects
you. BUT all your (non-artifact) items are disintegrated! (hmm... maybe
this is too much?)

